The contract contains a critical vulnerability where account closure transactions do not validate the close remainder address, allowing complete drainage of funds.

### Vulnerability: Unchecked Close Remainder To
### Explanation: The contract fails to validate the `close_remainder_to` field in account closure transactions, allowing an attacker to specify any address and drain the entire escrow account balance when the close condition is met.
### Risk: Critical - Complete loss of all funds in the escrow account
